  "title": "Summit Midstream Corporation Announces Inaugural $35 Million Stock Repurchase Program",
  "summary": "HOUSTON, June 1, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Summit Midstream Corporation (NYSE: SMC) (\"Summit,\" \"SMC\" or the \"Company\") today announced that its Board of Directors has authorized the Company's inaugural stock repurchase program to repurchase up to $35 million of the Company's outstanding common stock.",
